{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-7","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：整数","englishTitle":"If a composite number by multiplying any number make some number, the product will be solid.","book":9,"number":7,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.7","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.7/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":7,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-7@raw-9d447d7ad5e07ead","contentId":"euclid-9-7","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9d447d7ad5e07ead64ced171cca26dab5c40ae325720fcf9e30638106365fda2","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-7.statement","euclid-9-7.construction.1","euclid-9-7.proof.1","euclid-9-7.construction.2","euclid-9-7.proof.2","euclid-9-7.proof.3","euclid-9-7.conclusion","euclid-9-7.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-7.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-7","revisionId":"euclid-9-7@raw-9d447d7ad5e07ead","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"12abc4baa4ebcf65f4fef67beefe1d48b0489d169eca58337e012c6d00b32ec3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a composite number by multiplying any number make some number, the product will be solid."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果乘以任何数字的合数 得出一定数字,则产品将是固体的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-7.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-7","revisionId":"euclid-9-7@raw-9d447d7ad5e07ead","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88c9a8cd20b2ec29408d710156a48a1017fa30c874b2d192e1833b1b400708f0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the composite number A by multiplying any number B make C; I say that C is solid."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将合数 A乘以B, 使C变为C; 我说C是固体。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-7.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-7","revisionId":"euclid-9-7@raw-9d447d7ad5e07ead","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0069bc1eeb5e8609c1688201f62fcc82c94fb0e0b42a38d1c40ed3435719460d","citations":["euclid-7-def-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A is composite, it will be measured by some number. [[VII. Def. 13](/principles/euclid-7-def-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A是复合的,所以将用一些数字来整除。 [[VII. Def. 13](/principles/euclid-7-def-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-7.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-7","revisionId":"euclid-9-7@raw-9d447d7ad5e07ead","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d496b6cda18661a0e76ec7ca7cd574364356df83092ce12a09bed15b01d918db","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be measured by D; and, as many times as D measures A, so many units let there be in E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"以D计,D 整除 A倍,这样多的单位倍,E倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-7.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-7","revisionId":"euclid-9-7@raw-9d447d7ad5e07ead","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0690ace11d5b528b00fe350411db857426a1d9952b48b490f3f4435635159965","citations":["euclid-7-def-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then D measures A according to the units in E, therefore E by multiplying D has made A. [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,根据E的单位数据,D 整除 A,因此,E乘以D, 使A。 [[VII. Def. 15](/principles/euclid-7-def-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-7.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-7","revisionId":"euclid-9-7@raw-9d447d7ad5e07ead","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"160c78b5250246160ef37cef96df004e19a40f9e3d42878acdaf458e80e95d81","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A by multiplying B has made C, and A is the product of D, E, therefore the product of D, E by multiplying B has made C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A乘以B 生产了C,A是D,E的产物 因此D,E乘以B 生产了C"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-7.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-7","revisionId":"euclid-9-7@raw-9d447d7ad5e07ead","order":6,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71fff10e5a43197eec554d7a03401c3a03dbe5ad52dfc1892615e186dd4caf5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C is solid, and D, E, B are its sides. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C是固体,D、E、B是其侧面。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-7.source","contentId":"euclid-9-7","revisionId":"euclid-9-7@raw-9d447d7ad5e07ead","order":7,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"deed98bdcea970c2b062a87a1838ce8092209f2f474aaca91ea4007fcca8586a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.7/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.7\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-9-7:euclid-7-def-13:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-7.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-13","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 13"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-9-7:euclid-7-def-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-9-7","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-9-7.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.7","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.7/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 15"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-7:euclid-7-def-13:explicit","id":"euclid-7-def-13","book":7,"number":13,"kind":"definition","title":"合数：可以被某个整数整除","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-9-7:euclid-7-def-15:explicit","id":"euclid-7-def-15","book":7,"number":15,"kind":"definition","title":"整数乘法：重复相加","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
